  "priorExpiration": "2008-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4604.01 Complaints.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 359-T:15, complaints regarding carriers of household goods shall be filed with the bureau in writing.\n\n(b) The complainant shall state:\n\n(1) The nature of the complaint; and\n\n(2) All information available to support the complaint.\n\n(c) All complaints shall be processed pursuant to Saf-C 203.01.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
